#: ../../source/cosmiconfig_README.md:6
msgid "Cosmiconfig searches for and loads configuration for your program."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/cosmiconfig_README.md:8
msgid ""
"It features smart defaults based on conventional expectations in the "
"JavaScript ecosystem. But it's also flexible enough to search wherever "
"you'd like to search, and load whatever you'd like to load."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/cosmiconfig_README.md:11
msgid ""
"By default, Cosmiconfig will start where you tell it to start and search "
"up the directory tree for the following:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/cosmiconfig_README.md:13
msgid "a `package.json` property"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/cosmiconfig_README.md:14
msgid "a JSON or YAML, extensionless \"rc file\""
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/cosmiconfig_README.md:15
msgid "an \"rc file\" with the extensions `.json`, `.yaml`, `.yml`, or `.js`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/cosmiconfig_README.md:16
msgid "a `.config.js` CommonJS module"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/cosmiconfig_README.md:18
msgid ""
"For example, if your module's name is \"soursocks\", cosmiconfig will "
"search up the directory tree for configuration in the following places:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/cosmiconfig_README.md:20
msgid "a `soursocks` property in `package.json`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/cosmiconfig_README.md:21
msgid "a `.soursocksrc` file in JSON or YAML format"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/cosmiconfig_README.md:22
msgid "a `.soursocksrc.json` file"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/cosmiconfig_README.md:23
msgid "a `.soursocksrc.yaml`, `.soursocksrc.yml`, or `.soursocksrc.js` file"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/cosmiconfig_README.md:24
msgid "a `soursocks.config.js` file exporting a JS object"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/cosmiconfig_README.md:26
msgid ""
"Cosmiconfig continues to search up the directory tree, checking each of "
"these places in each directory, until it finds some acceptable "
"configuration (or hits the home directory)."
msgstr ""

