"Loads a configuration file. Returns a Promise that resolves with a "
"[result] or rejects with an error (if the file does not exist or cannot "
"be loaded)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/cosmiconfig_README.md:184
msgid ""
"Use `load` if you already know where the configuration file is and you "
"just need to load it."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/cosmiconfig_README.md:190
msgid ""
"If you load a `package.json` file, the result will be derived from "
"whatever property is specified as your [`packageProp`]."
